WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.100 --> 00:00:04.049
- [Narrator] Imagine
hearing this in church.

00:00:04.049 --> 00:00:05.350
(heavy metal music)

00:00:05.350 --> 00:00:07.163
Well, in Finland, you can.

00:00:13.340 --> 00:00:16.070
- [Narrator] In fact, Finland
has the most heavy metal bands

00:00:16.070 --> 00:00:18.150
per capita in the world.

00:00:18.150 --> 00:00:20.209
It's so popular, it's showing up in places

00:00:20.209 --> 00:00:21.749
you wouldn't expect.

00:00:21.749 --> 00:00:24.749
(heavy metal music)

00:00:26.952 --> 00:00:30.050
(upbeat music)

00:00:30.050 --> 00:00:31.600
Meet the metal mass mastermind.

00:00:46.039 --> 00:00:47.420
- [Narrator] Heavy metal
might seem completely

00:00:47.420 --> 00:00:49.070
out of place at church,

00:00:49.070 --> 00:00:51.870
but the services aren't as
different as you might think.

00:01:13.550 --> 00:01:14.960
- [Narrator] You might
think the intense music

00:01:14.960 --> 00:01:16.930
would turn churchgoers off,

00:01:16.930 --> 00:01:19.073
but it's had just the opposite effect.

00:01:29.121 --> 00:01:32.121
(heavy metal music)

00:01:54.208 --> 00:01:57.208
(heavy metal music)

00:02:00.381 --> 00:02:01.223
(congregation applauding)
(foreign language spoken)

00:02:01.223 --> 00:02:04.140
(octave bell tone)

